# secrets/common.env — host-side secrets shared by ALL agents.
#
# Copy to secrets/common.env and fill in. NEVER commit the real file
# (secrets/*.env is gitignored; only *.example is tracked).
#
# These are injected into the container's PROCESS ENVIRONMENT at start time
# by sandbox.sh — they are NEVER written to ~/.hermes/.env inside the container,
# and never baked into the image. One line per KEY=VALUE. No quotes needed.
#
# Lines starting with # are ignored. Blank lines are ignored.

# Example (uncomment and fill):
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# GITHUB_TOKEN=github_pat_...
